<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11716] Web console: can&apos;t select cluster memory eviction mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11716</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;What happens:&lt;br/&gt;
Memory eviction mode select has no options to choose from and there&apos;s an error in console.&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12965439/12965439_image-2019-04-10-17-02-17-310.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected behavior:&lt;br/&gt;
The error should not happen, user should be able to select eviction mode.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note: select configuration version 2.1 to see &quot;memory&quot; section in advanced cluster configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
